{"2620220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Idle Mall Tycoon", "steam_appid": 2620220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620220/extras/b6e3666a2ed65a8a704d928f6f613811.avif?t=1787129800\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🖖 Do you like &quot;Idle Tycoon Clicker Game&quot; ?  🖖</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by building up your free cash flow with a clicker power business using windmills and solar panels! Supercharge your mall’s growth with a REAL business investment! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620220/extras/08c4ff36c5227d190f769e20b1d7e322.avif?t=1787129800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620220/extras_big/08c4ff36c5227d190f769e20b1d7e322.avif?t=1787129800 width=800 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧑‍💼<strong> Message From Your Assistant</strong> 🧑‍💼</h2></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1️⃣ With your passion for running a mall, you can bring your vision to life just as you imagine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2️⃣ Become the ultimate shopping mall tycoon by opening and expanding individual stores! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3️⃣ Let customers fill their shopping carts with a diverse range of products!&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620220/extras/47f57e6e9e868f469b2e8873020dd79b.avif?t=1787129800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620220/extras_big/47f57e6e9e868f469b2e8873020dd79b.avif?t=1787129800 width=800 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛒 Game Features 🛒</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐️ Enjoy a casual and strategic gameplay suitable for all players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐️ Immerse yourself in a realistic mall environment, including staff, customers, and buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐️ Experience the satisfaction of managing each store in the shopping mall, as revenue accumulates automatically and grows through reinvestment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐️ Explore an expanding world by opening new stores one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐️ Witness the transformation of your stores into more sophisticated establishments as you level them up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐️ Enjoy the multi-floor experience by growing a shopping mall with multiple levels, not just limited to the ground floor. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620220/extras/fb38caa7836fc8324d9b213b68b7a4ee.avif?t=1787129800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620220/extras_big/fb38caa7836fc8324d9b213b68b7a4ee.avif?t=1787129800 width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>🎮 Game Progression 🎮</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1️⃣ Open various stores such as cafes, game centers, gyms, food shops, and burger joints to continuously increase your sales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2️⃣ Increase the level of your opened stores to raise product prices and generate higher revenues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3️⃣ Once all the stores on the ground floor are open, you can expand to the second floor and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4️⃣ Expand the parking lot to accommodate more customers entering the shopping mall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5️⃣ Once you have an adequate number of parking spaces, invest in advertising to attract more customers to the parking lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620220/extras/a441a04db17ef8cde7cf585c971a324e.avif?t=1787129800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620220/extras_big/a441a04db17ef8cde7cf585c971a324e.avif?t=1787129800 width=800 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶️ Start with a single store and gradually build your empire by opening new and exciting shops. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From coffee shops to high-end electronics stores, each new addition will contribute to the completion of your dream mall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧑‍💼 Conduct market research to identify the most profitable businesses and attract a diverse range of customers.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design unique and captivating store layouts, offering a wide variety of products to cater to different tastes and preferences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 Hire skilled staff to provide excellent customer service and ensure a seamless shopping experience.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in advertising campaigns and promotional activities to attract more visitors and increase footfall in your mall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 As you continue to open new stores, watch your mall thrive and become a bustling hub of commerce and entertainment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your facilities, add amenities such as food courts and entertainment zones, and create a destination that shoppers can't resist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📣 Make strategic decisions, manage finances effectively, and listen to customer feedback to optimize the performance of your mall.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dedication and a keen business sense, transform each individual store into a masterpiece and build the ultimate shopping mall of your dreams!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620220/extras/b6e3666a2ed65a8a704d928f6f613811.avif?t=1787129800\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🖖 Do you like &quot;Idle Tycoon Clicker Game&quot; ?  🖖</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by building up your free cash flow with a clicker power business using windmills and solar panels! Supercharge your mall’s growth with a REAL business investment! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620220/extras/08c4ff36c5227d190f769e20b1d7e322.avif?t=1787129800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620220/extras_big/08c4ff36c5227d190f769e20b1d7e322.avif?t=1787129800 width=800 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧑‍💼<strong> Message From Your Assistant</strong> 🧑‍💼</h2></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1️⃣ With your passion for running a mall, you can bring your vision to life just as you imagine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2️⃣ Become the ultimate shopping mall tycoon by opening and expanding individual stores! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3️⃣ Let customers fill their shopping carts with a diverse range of products!&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620220/extras/47f57e6e9e868f469b2e8873020dd79b.avif?t=1787129800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620220/extras_big/47f57e6e9e8